{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.PieceAGeneral","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.PieceAGeneral","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic","lean:module:Mathlib.Combinatorics.Young.YoungDiagram"],"declarations":35,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.PieceA.pieceA","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.PieceA.pieceA","kind":"theorem","line":490,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/PieceAGeneral.lean#L490-L495","doc":"**Piece A — general `n`, sorry-free** (bean `qou-o5xj` closed):\n`Σ hook² = Σ content² + n²` for every Young diagram. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:lem:piece-a-hook-content-identity","label":"lem:piece-a-hook-content-identity","md":"quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/piece-a-hook-content-identity.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.PieceA.pairCount_holds","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.PieceA.pairCount_holds","kind":"theorem","line":444,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/PieceAGeneral.lean#L444-L488","doc":"**The pair-counting identity** (bean `qou-o5xj`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.PieceA.swap_reindex","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.PieceA.swap_reindex","kind":"theorem","line":434,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/PieceAGeneral.lean#L434-L442","doc":"Reindex a pair sum by `Prod.swap` (the cell-pair set is swap-symmetric). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.PieceA.sum_fst_eq_scLower","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.PieceA.sum_fst_eq_scLower","kind":"theorem","line":407,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/PieceAGeneral.lean#L407-L425","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.PieceA.sum_snd_eq_srLower","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.PieceA.sum_snd_eq_srLower","kind":"theorem","line":387,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/PieceAGeneral.lean#L387-L405","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.PieceA.scLowerPairs","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.PieceA.scLowerPairs","kind":"def","line":383,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/PieceAGeneral.lean#L383-L385","doc":"Same-column ordered pairs with the first cell strictly above. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.PieceA.srLowerPairs","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.PieceA.srLowerPairs","kind":"def","line":379,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/PieceAGeneral.lean#L379-L381","doc":"Same-row ordered pairs with the first cell strictly left. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.PieceA.fst_eq_card","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.PieceA.fst_eq_card","kind":"theorem","line":359,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/PieceAGeneral.lean#L359-L377","doc":"`q.1` counts the cells strictly above `q` in its column. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.PieceA.snd_eq_card","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.PieceA.snd_eq_card","kind":"theorem","line":344,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/PieceAGeneral.lean#L344-L357","doc":"`q.2` counts the cells strictly left of `q` in its row. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.PieceA.sum_prod_eq_ullr","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.PieceA.sum_prod_eq_ullr","kind":"theorem","line":316,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/PieceAGeneral.lean#L316-L337","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.PieceA.ullrPairs","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.PieceA.ullrPairs","kind":"def","line":312,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/PieceAGeneral.lean#L312-L314","doc":"The UL/LR ordered pair set: `a` strictly up-left of `q`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.PieceA.prod_eq_card","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.PieceA.prod_eq_card","kind":"theorem","line":296,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/PieceAGeneral.lean#L296-L310","doc":"`p.1·p.2` counts the cells strictly up-left of `p` (all present by down-closure). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.PieceA.sum_armLeg_eq_urll","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.PieceA.sum_armLeg_eq_urll","kind":"theorem","line":262,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/PieceAGeneral.lean#L262-L287","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.PieceA.urllPairs","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.PieceA.urllPairs","kind":"def","line":258,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/PieceAGeneral.lean#L258-L260","doc":"The UR/LL ordered pair set: `R` upper-right of `B`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.PieceA.legZ_eq_card","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.PieceA.legZ_eq_card","kind":"theorem","line":225,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/PieceAGeneral.lean#L225-L250","doc":"The leg length is the number of cells strictly below `p` in its column. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.PieceA.armZ_eq_card","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.PieceA.armZ_eq_card","kind":"theorem","line":206,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/PieceAGeneral.lean#L206-L223","doc":"The arm length is the number of cells strictly right of `p` in its row. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.PieceA.pieceA_of_pairCount","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.PieceA.pieceA_of_pairCount","kind":"theorem","line":192,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/PieceAGeneral.lean#L192-L202","doc":"**Piece A, given the pair-counting identity.** `Σ hook² = Σ content² + n²`.\nModulo the single `PairCount` hypothesis — which is itself discharged\nunconditionally by `pairCount_holds` (bean `qou-o5xj` closed), giving the\nsorry-free unconditional `pieceA` below; everything else — the reflections and\nthe separable reduction — is machine-checked. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.PieceA.PairCount","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.PieceA.PairCount","kind":"def","line":178,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/PieceAGeneral.lean#L178-L190","doc":"The pair-counting identity: the arm·leg, i·j, left and above sums account for\nevery ordered distinct-cell pair. Proved sorry-free by `pairCount_holds` below\n(bean `qou-o5xj` closed); the proof: express `armZ`/`legZ`\nas `Finset.card` of arm/leg filters, expand the product to a triple sum\n`Σ_c Σ_R Σ_B`, collapse the `c`-sum (`c = (R.1, B.2)` is forced) to\n`#{(R,B) : R.1<B.1 ∧ B.2<R.2}`, likewise `Σ(i·j) = #{(A,L) UL/LR}`, then\n`card²−card = Σ_{p,q}[p≠q]` split into the four disjoint position classes. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.PieceA.pieceA_reduction","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.PieceA.pieceA_reduction","kind":"theorem","line":143,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/PieceAGeneral.lean#L143-L168","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.PieceA.sum_legZ_generic","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.PieceA.sum_legZ_generic","kind":"theorem","line":125,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/PieceAGeneral.lean#L125-L136","doc":"**Leg reflection.** For any `F`, summing `F(leg)` over the cells equals summing\n`F(above-count i)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.PieceA.sum_swap_transpose","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.PieceA.sum_swap_transpose","kind":"theorem","line":111,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/PieceAGeneral.lean#L111-L123","doc":"Reindex a cell sum by `swap` to the transpose diagram. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.PieceA.legZ_eq_transpose_armZ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.PieceA.legZ_eq_transpose_armZ","kind":"theorem","line":106,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/PieceAGeneral.lean#L106-L109","doc":"Legs of `μ` are arms of the transpose (swapped): `leg μ c = arm μᵀ c.swap`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.PieceA.sum_armZ_generic","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.PieceA.sum_armZ_generic","kind":"theorem","line":95,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/PieceAGeneral.lean#L95-L102","doc":"**Row reflection.** For any `F`, summing `F(arm)` over the cells equals summing\n`F(left-count j)` — the arm/left multisets agree per row. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.PieceA.armZ_eq_rowRefl_snd","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.PieceA.armZ_eq_rowRefl_snd","kind":"theorem","line":89,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/PieceAGeneral.lean#L89-L93","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.PieceA.rowRefl_invol","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.PieceA.rowRefl_invol","kind":"theorem","line":81,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/PieceAGeneral.lean#L81-L87","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.PieceA.rowRefl_mem","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.PieceA.rowRefl_mem","kind":"theorem","line":74,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/PieceAGeneral.lean#L74-L79","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.PieceA.mem_cells_iff_snd_lt","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.PieceA.mem_cells_iff_snd_lt","kind":"theorem","line":70,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/PieceAGeneral.lean#L70-L72","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.PieceA.rowRefl","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.PieceA.rowRefl","kind":"def","line":66,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/PieceAGeneral.lean#L66-L68","doc":"Row reflection `(i,j) ↦ (i, rowLen i − 1 − j)` — an involution on cells that\nsends the arm length to the left-count `j`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.PieceA.legZ_nonneg","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.PieceA.legZ_nonneg","kind":"theorem","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/PieceAGeneral.lean#L55-L62","doc":"For a genuine cell, the leg is non-negative (`i < colLen j`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.PieceA.armZ_nonneg","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.PieceA.armZ_nonneg","kind":"theorem","line":46,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/PieceAGeneral.lean#L46-L53","doc":"For a genuine cell, the arm is non-negative (`j < rowLen i`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.PieceA.hookZ_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.PieceA.hookZ_eq","kind":"theorem","line":42,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/PieceAGeneral.lean#L42-L44","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.PieceA.contentZ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.PieceA.contentZ","kind":"def","line":39,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/PieceAGeneral.lean#L39-L40","doc":"Content `= j − i`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.PieceA.hookZ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.PieceA.hookZ","kind":"def","line":36,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/PieceAGeneral.lean#L36-L37","doc":"Hook length `= arm + leg + 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.PieceA.legZ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.PieceA.legZ","kind":"def","line":33,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/PieceAGeneral.lean#L33-L34","doc":"Leg length of cell `c=(i,j)` in `μ`, over `ℤ`: cells strictly below in the column. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.PieceA.armZ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.PieceA.armZ","kind":"def","line":30,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/PieceAGeneral.lean#L30-L31","doc":"Arm length of cell `c=(i,j)` in `μ`, over `ℤ`: cells strictly right in the row. ","signatureChunk":0}]}